  "mathematical_definition": "Parent range_cv4_reported definition (historical reference, replaced where the change applies): 静态距离d_i=||x-a_i||，恒速距离d_i=||x+t_i v-a_i||，残差r_i=(d_i-y_i)/sigma_i。拟合目标为sum_i 2c^2(sqrt(1+(r_i/c)^2)-1)+lambda||v||^2，其中c=1.5、lambda=0.05，静态不含速度罚项。按时间排序作K=4交错折，每个模型的验证分数为所有留出观测的平均2(sqrt(1+r_i^2)-1)。仅在每个恒速训练折均满足至少6个观测、至少1秒时间跨度、数据Jacobian满秩且无活跃数值边界，并且CV_velocity<0.95 CV_static时选恒速，否则选静态。内折使用一个普通起点，最终用三个起点全数据重拟合；无截尾或抽样初始化。n-ceil(n/4)=6在n=8成立只是数量必要条件。与v2唯一有效配置差异为cv_folds。\nControlled change: starts: 3 -> 1.\nThe final objective and model are defined by localization/method_math.md using this complete effective specification, which overrides the corresponding parent formula: {\"consensus_trials\": 0, \"cv_folds\": 4, \"f_scale\": 1.5, \"gate_margin\": 0.05, \"log_bias_correction\": true, \"log_sd\": 0.1, \"loss\": \"soft_l1\", \"model\": \"cv_select\", \"residual\": \"range\", \"ridge\": 0.05, \"scale\": \"reported\", \"seed\": 0, \"starts\": 1, \"trim_fraction\": 0.0}",
